{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1166181-klaive-duel-maneuvers-in-w20","id":1166181,"title":"Klaive Duel maneuvers in W20","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-12-08T15:52:06-08:00","id":1166181,"title":"Klaive Duel maneuvers in W20","content":"How do you use klaives' dueling maneuvers in the 20th Anniversary Edition?<br /> I felt insecure to use the rules of the Player's Guide REVISED, seemed unbalanced in relation to the rules of W20.<br /> <br /> I particularly use the rules of the V20 Dark Ages (page 347).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23580-baskin","name":"Baskin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-09T12:16:03-08:00","id":1166319,"title":"","content":"I let my players take it as a Specialisation in W20 with the added advantage of -1 Difficulty to combat manuevers using a Klaive.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-09T23:09:15-08:00","id":1166424,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Moirdryd</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1166181-klaive-duel-maneuvers-in-w20?p=1166319#post1166319\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I let my players take it as a Specialisation in W20 with the added advantage of -1 Difficulty to combat manuevers using a Klaive.</div> </div> </div> </div>it seems fair to me.<br /> And what is the difference between who has the specialization of meele and who has secondary ability?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23580-baskin","name":"Baskin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T02:32:34-08:00","id":1166437,"title":"","content":"An old general rule in revized was that a meele specialization in klaive dueling just gave you the reroll 10 rule whch translates in 10=success x 2.<br /> While when you chose klaive dueling as a secondary skill you character would enjoy a -1 difficulty while using klaives alone, but no reroll 10 till you gained the klaive dueling skill at 4 dots.<br /> The same happened with all specialized skill, like archery and wrestling instead of athletics. If a wrestling maneuver for instance was diff 7 with athletics, with the wrestling skil was difficulty 6.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T06:36:15-08:00","id":1166454,"title":"","content":"I just use the Specialization in W20 and don't bother with the secondary skill for Klaivaskar","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2767-moirdryd","name":"Moirdryd","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2767_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"490"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T07:02:46-08:00","id":1166460,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baskin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1166181-klaive-duel-maneuvers-in-w20?p=1166424#post1166424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">it seems fair to me.<br /> And what is the difference between who has the specialization of meele and who has secondary ability?</div> </div> </div> </div>Secondary skill is -1 difficulty, specialization is 10 counts a 2 successes. That said i would never, personally, allow Klaive as a Secondary skill. <br /> <br /> Klaive dueling maybe but not Klaive. Because the difference between the Melee and Klaive is so minimal as to pointless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2179-lokiravenspeak","name":"LokiRavenSpeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1117"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T07:59:45-08:00","id":1166465,"title":"","content":"Nice. It became pretty clear to me the implications of specialization and secondary skill. Thank you all<br /> <br /> But what about the combat maneuvers in the revised books? Maneuvers like Silver Shield, Blind, Feint, Riposte, and all others.<br /> Do you use the list of maneuvers from the revised books or use some house rules?<br /> <br /> Expressing my concern again: revised editions rules seemed unbalanced in relation to the rules of W20.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":23580,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23580-baskin","user":"Baskin","date":". 12-10-2017, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23580-baskin","name":"Baskin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23580_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T09:32:24-08:00","id":1166476,"title":"","content":"The klaive dueling techniques I think are fine as they are, the only problem for me is when the description of a maneuver needs more than 1 actions in order to be executed. Like leaping rake (klaive version), swinging slash, and fleche (!!!3!!! actions ???). The issue in revised was solved with Rage expediture,or splitting dice pool, and taking the whole maneuver as one action, I don't think thought that this is the case in W20 since the description says ''round'' instead of action, but it maybe needs an errata. Even then that counts towards the maximum Rage actions a werewolf may take per turn?<br /> <br /> What other problems you have discovered with revised version maneuvers?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":12906,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","user":"Story Letter","date":". 12-10-2017, 12:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12906-story-letter","name":"Story Letter","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12906_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"552"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}